        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Give me back my fruit&quot; is a single-player 2D platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a quick tutorial stage, then face a series of boss battles, each with unique and challenging patterns. Overcome adversity and reclaim your stolen fruit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To take back what’s yours, you’ll need to face off against quirky and mischievous enemies. Each boss has its own distinct attack patterns, and your movement and reflexes are key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One mistake can cost everything. stay focused, dodge with precision, and strike at the perfect moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you recover every piece of fruit and reach the ending?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against bosses with distinct personalities and patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short but intense battles designed to test your skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast retry loop and compact progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mini-game style adventure crafted with characters, music, and effects</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move: Left Key &amp; Right Key</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump: X</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack: Z</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restart: R</p></li></ul>",
